WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.363 --> 00:00:11.605
On this makeshift boat, some migrants will
have braved the ocean and its storms for

00:00:11.605 --> 00:00:13.605
several days.

00:00:13.605 --> 00:00:17.867
A small boat made with metal containers
and a tarp and an old engine.

00:00:21.092 --> 00:00:27.516
Vessels this size and they'll be packed
with anywhere from two people to 20 people

00:00:27.516 --> 00:00:29.516
aboard a vessel like this.

00:00:29.516 --> 00:00:29.978
As you can see, there's not much room in
there.

00:00:31.039 --> 00:00:32.540
They have bottles and bottles of water.

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:34.521
They never know how long they're going to
be out at sea.

00:00:34.861 --> 00:00:36.002
The boat's passengers are all in the boat.

00:00:36.002 --> 00:00:39.987
The dangers have probably been taken by
people smugglers off the coast of Miami.

00:00:40.868 --> 00:00:42.670
It's a desperate attempt to make it to the
U.S.

00:00:43.091 --> 00:00:44.332
by any means available to them.

00:00:44.913 --> 00:00:49.499
The Coast Guard intercepted almost 5,000
migrants out at sea in 2015,

00:00:50.079 --> 00:00:52.182
a figure which continues to increase.

